147+  0097              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
148+  0097              ; Receive one byte published by NeoGS.
149+  0097              ; OUT: A=data; carry clear. Carry set on timeout.
150+  0097              ; Reading GSDAT acknowledges the byte and clears DBIT in the host view.
151+  0097              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
